The audit counterexample satisfies the numerical mesh identities and has
nonpositive cycle works, but its displayed scaled conclusion is false.  The
source-preserving bridge below is therefore not a wrapper around this retired
statement: it keeps the support/smooth-upper/Lipschitz data that this numerical
