and Lipschitz selected gradients on an open convex chart.

This is the source-derived Lan Lemma 5.8 analytic endpoint used by the uniform
mesh energy voucher below. Search audit: checked the pre-searched candidates
`Convex.carrier_smooth_quadratic_upper_bound`, `lipschitzWith_of_norm_sub_le_mul`,
and target-file hits `caller_endpoint_energy_from_support_upper_lipschitz`,
`open_zero_base_endpoint_energy_from_support_upper_lipschitz`, and
