/-- Ambient endpoint energy is controlled by the forward mesh work up to the
selected mesh-energy budget.

This is the remaining finite-dimensional discretization bridge in Lan Lemma
5.8's open-domain proof: with the actual ambient gradient field along the
segment from the zero base point, the endpoint gradient energy is bounded by
