explicit `L^2‖u-z‖^2/n` discretization error absorbed into `ε/2`. No SOptLib
match: checked `finite_cone_reflection_step`,
`forward_local_pair_gap_sum_controls_mesh_energy_budget`,
`reverse_uniform_partition_work_sum_from_local_pair`, and searched `endpoint
energy partition increments norm square sum`; available lemmas provide cone
algebra, mesh work budgets, or unrelated stochastic finite-sum norm identities,
